---
import SiteLayout from '../../../components/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Atlas GarageOS handles data — no accounts, minimal analytics, nothing sold." pathname="/en/privacy-policy/" active="tools" breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/en/' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/en/privacy-policy/' }]}>
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</span></nav>
  <header class="directory-identity"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Last updated September 2026.</p></header>
  <div class="tool-explanation">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>Atlas GarageOS does not require an account, a login, or an email address to use any calculator. The numbers you type into a tool (tire size, fuel price, wheel offset, and so on) are processed in your own browser to produce a result. We do not store the values you enter on our servers.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Cloudflare's built-in web analytics to see aggregate traffic — for example, how many people visited a page, or which country a visit came from. This does not use cookies and does not build an individual profile of you.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We do not use advertising or tracking cookies today. If we introduce sponsorships or ads in the future, this page will be updated first, and any cookie use will be disclosed here before it goes live.</p>
    <h2>Saved data (My Garage)</h2>
    <p>If you use a feature that saves a vehicle or a setup to "My Garage," that information is stored in your own browser's local storage on your device. It is not uploaded to our servers unless a future version explicitly says so, at which point this page will be updated.</p>
    <h2>Third parties</h2>
    <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your data with third parties. This site is hosted on Cloudflare, which processes standard web traffic (IP address, request logs) to serve the pages you request, as any hosting provider does.</p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Atlas GarageOS is a general-audience tool and is not directed at children under 13.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to the contact address listed on our homepage or GitHub repository.</p>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
